Subject: I'm Leaving Enron


I am going to be the Senior Regulatory Counsel at ISO New England starting
on April 9, 2001.   My last day in the Portland area will be March 31,
2001.  I enjoyed working with you and wish you the best of everything.  My
new address will be:

Mary Hain
Senior Regulatory Counsel
ISO New England Inc.
One Sullivan Road
Holyoke, MA  01040-2841
(413) 535-4000
mhain@ISO-NE.com

Message-ID: <25787776.1075860407879.JavaMail.evans@thyme>
Date: Fri, 23 Mar 2001 04:20:00 -0800 (PST)
From: srlarson@bpa.gov
To: mary.hain@enron.com
Subject: RE: I'm Leaving Enron
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-From: "Larson, Stephen R - LT-7" <srlarson@bpa.gov>
X-To: "'Mary.Hain@enron.com'" <Mary.Hain@enron.com>
X-cc: 
X-bcc: 
X-Folder: \Mary_Hain_Aug2000_Jul2001\Notes Folders\Discussion threads
X-Origin: Hain-M
X-FileName: mary-hain.nsf

Mary -- congratulations!!  New England seems to be a special place for you.
I will miss your up-to-date and extensive regulatory knowledge and your
ability to help folks get to "yes."  Hope you can keep up poor struggling
neophytes in mind with some helpful suggestions as you take the reins at ISO
New England.

